# Whoever else gets the descriptor reads the function off it. So it lies in the field of the descriptor's layout, and goes where that goes.
# RUN: link members functions mechanisms=all
# CHECK-NOT: on-prototype L0 "m" function=
# CHECK-NOT: function f2 callers-known
